WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,610 --> 00:00:06,820
Then you can't just taste white noodles, right?

2
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:08,820
No need. I will go to the mountains every day from now on.

3
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:10,220
His mouthful of meat is indispensable

4
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:12,020
There's still more than two hundred and fifty yuan left.

5
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:13,820
The deadline is noon the day after tomorrow

6
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:16,020
You can't make up the money by hunting rabbits and trapping pheasants.

7
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:18,350
What are you going to do?

8
00:00:18,350 --> 00:00:20,550
You have already sold out everything that can be sold at home.

9
00:00:20,550 --> 00:00:21,750
Tomorrow morning

10
00:00:21,750 --> 00:00:24,150
I went into the wild boar forest and fucked a big one

11
00:00:24,150 --> 00:00:28,560
I have to be fully prepared this time

12
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:31,360
After all, the smallest wild boar in the Wild Boar Forest weighs three hundred pounds.

13
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:37,270
Finally waiting for you

14
00:00:37,270 --> 00:00:41,930
No, you can't shoot yet

15
00:00:42,330 --> 00:00:43,930
This guy is too big

16
00:00:43,930 --> 00:00:45,730
Lead into the trap first and then solve it

17
00:00:45,730 --> 00:01:12,910
Come chase me, it's so dangerous

18
00:01:12,910 --> 00:01:14,710
I almost finished playing with the noodles.

19
00:01:14,710 --> 00:01:16,310
It's no problem to pay off the debt now.
